+/*
+ * The message of a failed check is not formatted on the device:
+ * - CONFIG_LOG_CHECK_MESSAGES_DICT: a dictionary line (esp_log_dict.h) with the
+ *   message id and the raw arguments; format, file and line stay in the ELF file.
+ * - CONFIG_LOG_CHECK_MESSAGES_ADDRESS: "E chk <address> <code>" from one shared
+ *   function; the arguments are not evaluated.
+ *   (code + 0: the code is empty in ESP_RETURN_ON_FALSE(a, , ...) of void functions.)
